## 🔧 Configuration

### Environment Variables

Create `.env` file:

```bash
# Flask Configuration
FLASK_ENV=production
FLASK_APP=wsgi.py
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/medbot
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# Security
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-jwt-secret
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://yourdomain.com

# API Keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here (optional)
SENDGRID_API_KEY=your-key-here (optional)

# Monitoring
PROMETHEUS_URL=http://localhost:9090
GRAFANA_URL=http://localhost:3000

# AWS/Cloud Storage (optional)
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-secret
AWS_S3_BUCKET=medbot-bucket
```

### Model Configuration

Edit `ml/data/intents.json` to add new intents:

```json
{
  "intents": [
    {
      "tag": "custom_intent",
      "patterns": [
        "user query 1",
        "user query 2",
        "user query 3"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Response 1",
        "Response 2",
        "Response 3"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### Database Configuration

PostgreSQL setup:

```sql
-- Create database
CREATE DATABASE medbot;

-- Create user
CREATE USER medbot_user WITH PASSWORD 'secure_password';

-- Grant privileges
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE medbot TO medbot_user;
```

