## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Model Training Issues

```bash
# Check NLTK data is downloaded
python -c "import nltk; nltk.data.find('tokenizers/punkt')"

# Verify intents.json format
python -c "import json; json.load(open('ml/data/intents.json'))"

# Retrain model
rm ml/models/*.h5 ml/models/*.pkl
python ml/training/train.py
```

### API Connection Issues

```bash
# Check if API is running
curl http://localhost:5000/api/health

# View API logs
tail -f logs/api.log

# Restart API service
docker-compose restart backend
```

### Database Connection

```bash
# Test database connection
psql -U medbot_user -d medbot -c "SELECT 1;"

# Check Redis connection
redis-cli ping  # Should return PONG

# View database logs
tail -f /var/log/postgresql/postgresql.log
```

